<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CRACKER BARREL STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CRACKER BARREL STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said on Wednesday it started coverage of restaurant company Cracker Barrel Old Country Stores Inc with an attractive rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock gained 7/16 to 28-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
